+**★ THE SECOND COMPONENT WAS WRONG AS FIRST WRITTEN, AND THE CORRECTION IS THE
+WHOLE POINT OF THE PAIR, 2026-11-12 (joint round
+`severity_is_ordinal_2026-11-11_joint`, `fable` seat).** This block read: *"with
+`credence(f)` being today's §7.7 product under its own name."* Today's §7.7
+product is `W(class) · confidence · Ver(verification)`, and **`W` is the
